WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.409 --> 00:00:04.076
(dramatic orchestral music)

00:00:17.595 --> 00:00:20.677
- [Narrator] This is Yu Zhilin

00:00:20.677 --> 00:00:23.344
and this is his son, Yu Lingyun.

00:00:24.583 --> 00:00:26.008
Together they create incredible

00:00:26.008 --> 00:00:28.508
sculptures out of scrap metal.

00:00:33.422 --> 00:00:36.589
(uptempo piano music)

00:00:49.422 --> 00:00:51.027
- [Narrator] This father
son duo got their start

00:00:51.027 --> 00:00:53.527
making models of transformers.

00:01:20.261 --> 00:01:21.451
- [Narrator] The father and son went on

00:01:21.451 --> 00:01:24.130
to expand the business
beyond just transformers

00:01:24.130 --> 00:01:27.213
and began building their own designs.

